{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"i\": 1,\n      \"label\": \"有\",\n      \"sec\": \"S07–S08\",\n      \"why\": \"S07写出越努力不去追问、维持平静，未解决的问题就越突出、焦急就越强；S08接着明确说这次焦急让他更清楚自己对那个人有多在意。两段合起来形成了“压住感受—焦急反弹—照见眷恋”的因果链。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 2,\n      \"label\": \"部分\",\n      \"sec\": \"S07、S10\",\n      \"why\": \"稿子写出了未得到回答的问题反复回来、压住追问也无法消除不确定性。但没有真正写出反复追问为什么不能缩短两人的距离，也没有明确建立“不舍促使他不断提出新问题”的因果关系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 3,\n      \"label\": \"没有\",\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"why\": \"虽然提到说不清的熟悉感和身体先紧起来，但身体反应被解释为担心心意不对等、害怕暴露自己的在意，而不是熟悉感突然闯入后引发受惊，并反过来照见某种缺席。相似的感受元素存在，真正的因果却不同。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 4,\n      \"label\": \"部分\",\n      \"sec\": \"S10–S11\",\n      \"why\": \"S10写出反复起落消耗急切的力量，使强烈的焦虑转为疲倦的牵挂；S11也写出他重新获得向前的力量。但这份力量被明确归因于更广阔的生活和归属感，而不是想念本身转化成了继续向前的动力。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"invented\": [\n    \"S01–S13反复把叙述主体设定为男性，并安排他牵挂某个具体对象、等待对方回应且始终未能确认对方心意的关系情境。这是一组无法由音乐本身证实的人物身份与外部情节设定，尤其是S08“对方仍然没有给出新的回应”将未回应写成了既定事实。\"\n  ],\n  \"loops\": [\n    \"S07：把“暂时不追问以保住平静—短暂压低急迫感—疑问重新突出、焦急反扑”写成了显式的应对循环。这是最明显的一处策略试错式叙述，不过它主要是同一策略失效后回到原先的焦急，并没有真正发展出第二种不同的应对办法。\"\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ba7ff90b-b5ad-45f4-b8f9-29647b6faef0", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T214607842795Z", "elapsed_seconds": 225.578, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T21:49:53.434863+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "4b2ce15dc20393fde6b0921a7f29fcfa30ad355efb5c7fc0e659c9e18fcb142d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T214607842795Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "dd75586da221ff93ed67cb88103c4b8fa707a5be4d66d14166e9529e593e222d"}}}
